      (dsR6_42 (lvR6_42 inputs)) 3259730800 (interpDag (raw.toDag (cnstw F)) inputs 36344)
      hma hmb hmc hmd hme hmp
      (by norm_num [gR6_42a]) (by norm_num [gR6_42b]) (by norm_num [gR6_42c]) (by norm_num [gR6_42d]) (by norm_num [gR6_42e]) (by norm_num [dsR6_42])
